                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Nejoki Yesu ninche, “Esipa ajoki intae, ore intae likitusuja nanu, ore te nkop ng'ejuk te neton akenya Enkerai e Tung'ani to lorika le nkitoo enye, ore intae likitusuja nanu nitonini sii intae too lorikan tomon o aare aaiguanare lelo oshon tomon o aare le Israel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.19.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.19.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
